::: {#57ee2ea1 .cell execution_count=40}
``` {.python .cell-code}
pf.etable(
    fits,
    type="md",
    keep="X1",
    labels={"X1": "Treatment", "Y": "Outcome"},
    coef_fmt="b (se) [p]",
    model_heads=["No controls", "With fixed effects"],
    head_order="hd",
)
```

